WEBVTT

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:03.370
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:06.250
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.470
You've been naughty! Confess your guilt!

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.160
We wouldn't need police if you could be forgiven so easily!

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.650
Naughty detectives, love you!

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:20.340
That was so good!

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.750
Those two were spot on.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:23.590
Right?

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.170
Looks like you're having fun.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.670
Mizuki-san.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.290
You two really are "Naughty Detectives".

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:35.400
Mizuki-chan was watching—I'm so embarrassed!

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.050
Didn't think <i>she'd</i> see us.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.210
Soulless.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:42.930
It's just an imitation.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.280
Hi, signalize!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:06.620
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:06.620
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.510
No, that's wrong

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.510
iie chigau yo

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:13.890
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:13.890
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:15.680
Do that signalize!

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:20.860
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:20.860
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:24.820
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:24.820
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:28.360
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:28.360
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:33.530
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:33.530
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.870
Chance for me

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:40.170
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:40.170
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:44.380
It's just another challenge on the way

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:44.380
hora chousen matteru yo

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:49.300
Where are we headed?

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:49.300
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:53.050
Into a brilliant hope

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:53.050
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:01:53.640 --> 00:02:00.310
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:01:53.640 --> 00:02:00.310
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:03.690
Where we're headed

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:03.690
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:07.570
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:07.570
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:14.910
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:14.910
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:24.450
Good morning, everyone.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:30.460
Auditions will soon be held to be added to the cast of the popular drama, "Naughty Detectives".

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.120
I believe this is the first time you first-years have had this kind of opportunity.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:37.850
I expect you all to try your hardest to reach your field of dreams. {In your position, set.}

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.150
Awesome! There'll be an audition for "Naughty Detectives"!

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:44.770
This could be our chance!

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:45.630
You're taking it, right?

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.720
No way I wouldn't!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.970
The two heroines are both graduates of Starlight Academy.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:54.190
Let's follow their precedent of success and get our own roles! {Thanks, Chieri}

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.730
Yeah, let's do it!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:03.620
I knew you'd try out for a role in 
"Naughty Detectives" too, Otome-chan.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.710
Aye!

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:09.500
I've never been in a drama before, so I thought I'd give it a try.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.170
Isn't it so incredibly cool that we could 
appear in such a popular drama?

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.000
I'm getting pumped up!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.530
That's only if we manage to pass.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:25.070
"Naughty Detectives" quickly rose in the rankings in its first and second seasons,

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:31.690
and in the third season, the Naughty Detective Combo, Aki and Saki, will be joined by new recruits.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:36.610
Expectations are soaring for the powered-up third season of "Naughty Detectives".

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.930
There really are all sorts of idols out there.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.860
Just look at these two Starlight Academy graduates.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:47.530
There are those who go into acting, and those who focus on their singing.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:54.440
After I watched "Naughty Detectives", I seriously considered starring in a drama myself.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:57.300
That's why I want to pass this audition so badly!

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.270
Yeah!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.830
We aren't the ones you should apologize to.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.550
And there's a duty you must fulfill even before that!

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:08.560
Confess your guilt; only then will your path be opened!

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:11.000
Love you! Bravo!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.640
You two really do love "Naughty Detectives".

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:18.150
Ichigo, listen—when you say "confess your guilt",

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.540
you should be as serious as the real Naughty Detectives.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.650
"Confess your guilt!" Like that?

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:26.160
Much better!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.030
That was perfect.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:31.700
I don't mind you practicing now, but shouldn't you eat first?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.660
Your food's getting cold.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.100
You're right.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.900
I got a bit too excited.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.640
Let's eat up so that we can give our all!

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:40.710
Yeah!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.250
I won't lose to an imitation. {She's talking about how you have to bring something unique to your role and not just imitate others}

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:46.430
That girl is...

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.680
Kamiya Shion-chan.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.100
I know that name!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.120
She debuted as an actress at age 10.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:57.390
She was immediately recognized as a genius child actor and a genuine star.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:02.610
She's usually cool and quiet, but when she takes the stage her expression changes completely! {upcoming pun lost in translation}

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.530
They call her the "Actress of Seven Faces".

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.790
That's a pretty good estimation of how Shion is.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.100
Ran, you know her?

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:15.330
We've just run into each other a few times during work.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.760
But just what did she mean by that earlier?

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:21.820
She said "I won't lose to an imitation."

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:27.530
I bet Shion-chan's taking the audition for "Naughty Detectives" too.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.980
Most likely.

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:31.930
She seems to be pretty serious from the way she was acting.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.110
She'll be tough to beat. I can't let up.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:36.980
Yeah, it'll be fun!

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:44.820
Look at her run!

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:46.850
She's booking it after the suspect.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:47.560
Yeah.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:48.490
Stop right there!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.820
You won't get away!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.830
I'm sorry, please forgive me!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.750
We aren't the ones you should apologize to.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.640
Give yourself up.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:00.040
There's a duty you must fulfill.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.570
So cool!

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.190
They caught him again this episode.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.420
Too bad the bad guy was a bit lame this time.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:08.970
Not at all, it's just that the Naughty Combo was too strong.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:10.410
That's right.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:13.770
Suspect apprehended! We're taking him downtown!

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.940
Save your excuses for the station.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:16.970
They really are...

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:19.160
Too cool!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.100
I'd love to be in this drama.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.140
I want to be a Naughty Detective!

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:26.090
Right?

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.160
Suspect apprehended!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.740
So this is the end...

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.610
I can see you behind bars! {super liberal, lit. "realistic acting"}

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:39.290
But there one thing that's still bothering me.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.570
It's what Shion-chan said during lunch.

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:44.530
She said she "Won't lose to an imitation."

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:45.760
Aoi...

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:51.630
Shion-chan seems like she wouldn't be swayed no matter what happened.

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.940
No, I won't be able to make it like this.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.290
Listen, honeys.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:21.160
The details of the "Naughty Detectives" audition have been confirmed.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.310
Do you want to know?

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.730
Do you want to pass the audition?

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:28.020
Do you want to achieve your dreams?!

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:31.690
He's... trying to act like a detective?

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.430
It doesn't really fit him.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:36.430
This atmosphere is telling me that I've failed.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:37.720
That being the case...

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:44.570
Honeys! I've got big news!

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:46.150
Good job, me.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.690
Now that's more like him.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:52.740
There will be two roles for new officers in this audition.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:56.130
The first is a boyish and physically able character.

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:58.920
The other does profiling.

00:07:58.920 --> 00:07:59.660
Meaning...

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:06.170
An intellectual character who utilizes science in their pursuit of criminals.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.920
A boyish or intellectual character...

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.220
Which should I do?

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:15.460
It's up to you to choose which character you'll try out for.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:18.470
Choose whichever you feel suits you best.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:19.700
What to do?

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.430
Which should I go for?

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:24.390
For your information, the key to this audition

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:27.820
will be the ability to ad-lib!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:31.770
Much like I did earlier, read the 
atmosphere and act accordingly.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.890
Now I'm in trouble... {help}

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.950
Which is the character for me?

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:40.020
There's a boyish character and an intellectual one...

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.400
Which are you doing, Aoi?

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:44.140
I think I'll try for the intellectual type.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.000
And Ran?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.220
Same as Aoi.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.140
That does seem to suit you both.

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.460
Let's do this like we always do.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.460
Sure...

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.630
...is what I'd like to say,

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:56.930
but I'm going to give even more than usual this time. What about you, Ichigo?

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.250
Which should I pick...

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:02.250
The boyish officer seems really cool,

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.480
but the intellectual one is nice too.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.220
I can't decide...

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:12.460
I can't do this! Guess I'll choose by picking petals off a flower.

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.330
Using a flower, huh?

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.570
Ichigo doesn't really fit the intellectual type.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.390
Oh, you think so?

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:21.090
You don't think I fit that image?

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.340
You don't.

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:24.700
I'd have to agree with that.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:26.270
How so?

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:29.090
Well... everything.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:32.880
I see. Then I'll go for the boyish character.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.700
Now that that's decided let's get to practice!

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.260
Culprit apprehended!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.390
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:44.060
Ichigo really never changes no matter what she does.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.880
That's right. She'll always be herself.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:55.610
I'm worried about what Johnny-sensei said about having to ad-lib.

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:58.600
They're probably looking to assess <i>our </i> characters.

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:02.280
They're not looking for someone who can only say their lines.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.030
I'm really nervous.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.120
I'm not good at ad-libbing either.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.750
So even <i>you</i> have things you're not good at.

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.330
Of course I do.

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:16.060
Wow... but both you and Shion-chan give off an aura of being able to do anything.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:19.140
All I do is hide my weak points.

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:23.350
I'm sure that Shion is the same.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.690
Look over there!

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.410
Shion-chan chopped all her hair off!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:48.870
Surpri-rised!

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:01.800
Shion-chan's hair is super short now.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.780
She cut so much of it off.

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:05.310
It's probably method acting.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.310
There's no doubt about it.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:10.180
What's method acting?

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:15.010
Got it! I bet Shion-chan's applying for the boyish character.

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:15.860
Love!

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:20.490
You're saying she cut her hair <i>just</i> for the audition?!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.370
I think so.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:26.490
To be exact, it's because she wants to pass the audition.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:31.320
Right. She went out of the way cut her hair for the role.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:33.000
Amazing.

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:37.600
She's acting like a true pro. On the other hand, look at me...

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:44.660
Stop right there!

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:45.760
You won't get away!

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.020
I'm sorry, please forgive me!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.770
We wouldn't need police if you could be forgiven so easily!

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:53.810
Confess your guilt!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:54.810
I will!

00:11:58.330 --> 00:11:59.360
No good.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.250
What's wrong, Aoi?

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:04.970
All I'm doing right now is just a poor impression.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.950
No matter how many times I rewatch the drama and try to copy it exactly,

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.110
in the end, it's just an imitation.

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:14.170
It's not <i>my</i> acting.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.250
Aoi, let's go for a run.

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:23.150
Come on!

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:35.210
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! {I think it's still two at a time, like usual...}

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.490
Goal!

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:40.820
What's up? Why'd you want to run so suddenly?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.560
It's because you were looking gloomy.

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:46.570
I thought you might feel better after a bit of exercise.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:50.180
Yeah, I wasn't thinking about that much while we were running,

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.230
and I feel like I can sleep well now.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:53.820
Thanks, Ichigo.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.460
Headmistress.

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.720
It's almost lights-out time, you know. {Grammar}

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.180
W-We're sorry.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:05.150
We were just nervous about the upcoming audition and couldn't sleep.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:08.200
Nervous, huh. That's not such a bad thing.

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:13.870
There's another girl taking the audition with us who said she "won't lose to an imitation."

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:17.940
That's why, rather than imitate someone else,

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.170
I want to do my <i>own</i> acting.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:22.610
The one who said that was Kamiya, correct?

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:26.670
Don't you think she's directing those words at herself?

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.450
It's in order to confirm her motivation.

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:29.950
Motivation?

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:36.680
To renew her vow to live within the spotlight as an actress. Now... and forever.

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:41.930
Come now, it's bedtime.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:44.300
Sleeping well is also part of your curriculum.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.520
Yes.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.890
Shion-chan's determination is amazing.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.280
You're still awake.

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.520
You too.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:14:01.550
Shion-chan puts everything she has into being an actress.

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:02.460
Yeah.

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:03.900
Let's do our best too.

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:07.090
Let's do it.

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:13.380
<i>I'm a detective. I'll chase a suspect to the ends of the Earth.</i>

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:21.090
<i>I used to have no self-confidence.</i>

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:24.240
<i>Everyone around me was shining so brightly...</i>

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:28.240
<i>But I had nothing.</i>

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:36.280
<i>However, I was able to become </i>someone<i> while in that role.</i>

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:41.340
<i>Even though she was just a nameless girl, I became her completely.</i>

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.940
<i>I was truly happy.</i>

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:49.800
<i>I want to be able to act like that forever.</i>

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:52.830
<i>I finally found the place where I can be happy.</i>

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:00.350
You're up early.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.520
Sorry, did I wake you?

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.210
Nope. What're you doing?

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.960
I'm researching about profiling.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:12.510
But it's really difficult... I need to be thorough.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:14.470
That's just like you.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:19.850
I want to know exactly what kind of person becomes a profiling specialist.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.660
What kind of life she lives, and what she thinks about...

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.980
Why did she decide to become a detective?

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:31.990
I'm sure she just couldn't help herself... but why?

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.410
Ah, Aoi! The time!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:38.740
Oh no! We're gonna be late!

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:40.260
Let's step on it!

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:45.160
Since then, Aoi devoted herself to the role.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:48.420
Eventually, the day of the audition was upon us.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.990
So there really isn't a script.

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:55.650
Just like Johnny-sensei told us, our ad-libbing skills will be tested.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:59.220
We're being recorded right from the start! It's nerve-wracking!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.070
Oh, it's Shion-chan.

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:08.480
You're right—Ichigo, I don't think you should talk to...

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.360
Shion-chan.

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:14.320
Let's both do our best out there today.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:18.540
Then don't distract me, I'm trying to concentrate.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.700
S-Sorry.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:22.520
C'mon, we've gotta focus too.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:29.880
Now then, what should today's outfit be?

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.630
Something detective-like...

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:35.640
This!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.170
Drama audition commencing.

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:42.920
Now filming.

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.080
So you're the newbie?

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:49.770
I wonder if you'll be able to keep up with us.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:56.280
U-Um, I-I'll do my best.

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:59.880
Saki-san and Aki-san, in the flesh!

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:02.680
So we'll be auditioning alongside those two...

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.540
Max nervousness.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.370
I'm so excited!

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:12.030
You're pretty amazing to be able to have fun in this sort of situation.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:14.010
Cut!

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:17.430
Next up is Hoshimiya Ichigo-san.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.120
Here!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.050
So quick...

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.260
Just like always.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.020
So you're the newbie?

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.500
I wonder if you'll be able to keep up with us.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:30.150
I can keep up! Running is my specialty.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.280
Well you're nice and energetic.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:35.530
Then could you take that energy and brew us some hot tea?

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.530
Huh? With my energy?

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.780
Normally is fine. Just make it normally.

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:42.790
Right! I'll do it normally.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:49.540
<i>Normally... normally...</i>

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.320
This development...

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:54.840
It's the sort of pattern where there's promised to be a big crash.

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:59.550
She'll do it. Ichigo's the type to keep her promises after all.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:06.430
Oh no...

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:07.890
Now she's done it...

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:11.940
Nice job!

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:14.060
Cut!

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:15.940
Stop rolling!

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:24.850
I wasn't able to act out anything besides the saluting.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:26.780
I'd say it was very Ichigo-like.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:27.770
Yeah.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.380
Next up is Kiriya Aoi-san.

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.460
Here!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.360
So you're the newbie?

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:37.900
I wonder if you'll be able to keep up with us.

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:40.050
I'll watch your back, you can count on me.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.390
That's reassuring to hear.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.770
But you want to join the profiling team, don't you?

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:47.180
I do.

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:49.190
Why? You don't like crime scenes?

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:52.440
N-No... that's not the reason.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:55.100
That's a really difficult question.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:57.190
And it's all ad-libbed too.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.200
Why do you want to do profiling?

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.280
Because there are those that seek the truth,

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:09.080
and because there are those waiting for the culprit to be arrested.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.590
Then you're the same as us.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:16.460
Yeah. Good luck.

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:18.090
Thank you!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.010
Aoi, that was great!

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.090
Yeah.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:24.220
And then it was Shion-chan's turn.

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:27.760
You've been naughty; confess your guilt!

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.810
If you'll confess then we'll lend you a hand. {too subtle?}{wow, even a year later it was too subtle}

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.010
He ran away right after apologizing.

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:33.810
What'll you do, rookie?

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.490
A crime has been committed right before my eyes.

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:37.440
One thing to do...

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.330
Suspect apprehended!

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.830
Cut!

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:51.980
Just now...

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:54.970
Yeah, I really saw the suspect.

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:59.820
<i>After everyone had finished auditioning, the two who passed were...</i>

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:03.970
Congratulations, you two are now the new detectives.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.470
Thank you very much!

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:07.300
Welcome to the Big Dipper Police Squad. {stupid jpn to eng conversions}

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:08.350
We're counting on you.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.600
We look forward to working with you!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:15.360
They're totally in sync. These new detectives can do it!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.990
They'll do it!

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:20.290
Naughty Detectives Part Three!

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.120
You did it, Aoi!

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:23.900
Congrats.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:27.380
Love you! Go out and catch all the criminals!

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:28.760
I'll do my best!

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:31.330
Shion-chan, congratulations.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.610
It was fun.

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:36.330
Today was fun for some reason.

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.050
Your acting—

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.970
No, your expression was great.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:45.470
You truly looked like a real detective back there.

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:48.440
You did too, Shion-chan.

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:01.220
<i>And so, the drama was recorded.</i>

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:07.370
I'm sorry, please forgive me!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.940
We aren't the ones you should apologize to.

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.870
And there's a duty you must fulfill even before that!

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:16.700
Repent and confess your guilt!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:18.060
Only then—

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.880
Will your path be opened!

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:21.130
Shut it!

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.590
Let me help you confess!

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:25.380
With just a bit of force!

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.240
Suspect apprehended!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:30.720
Apprehended!

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:36.100
Curse you...

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.350
You two were so cool!

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:41.690
Shion-chan seems like a completely different person than usual.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:44.790
That's the "Actress of Seven Faces" for you.

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:46.690
Next up is Ichigo's scene.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:47.860
Finally time.

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:53.450
<i>That right. I was able to act in a small part as an extra, but...</i>

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:56.000
We finally got our hands on decisive proof!

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:08.280
Nice job, rookie!

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:11.010
That's Onee-chan, right?

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:13.960
Yep, she's finally had her drama debut.

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:16.920
She's awesome, even if they didn't catch her face!

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:18.770
Congratulations, Ichigo.

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:22.440
Congratulations, Onee-chan, Aoi-neesan! {Aoi added in for clarity}

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:57.990
I'm going off to get premium cards too!

00:23:57.990 --> 00:24:01.350
So why are we helping an old lady search for her past?!

00:24:01.350 --> 00:24:03.860
Everything is for Love You power!

00:24:03.860 --> 00:24:05.380
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:06.670
Love under the camphor tree.

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:11.450
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
